# =============================================================================
# Scientific Data / OpenNeuro — repository .gitignore
# Version code, docs, reports (text), metadata, scripts, tests ONLY.
# Never version MRI imaging volumes, DICOM, full BIDS trees, or bulky derivatives.
# =============================================================================

